#: {{ux|en|'''Further''' to our recent telephone call, I am writing to clarify certain points raised.}}
#: {{ux|en|This example is '''further''' to the one on page 17.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|author=European Court of Human Rights|title=Turek v. Slovakia|section=marginal 110|date=14-02-2006|url=http://hudoc.echr.coe.int/eng?i=001-72354|issue=57986/00|passage=The Court notes that the applicant’s registration by the StB as their “agent” lies at the heart of the application. Although the Court has no jurisdiction ratione temporis to examine the registration as such, it observes that, '''further''' to his registration, the applicant was issued with a negative security clearance and his name and reputation were called into question.}}

